Description: PHI Matter controller adapter, built on connectedhomeip
 The southbound Matter controller for PHI core, built on the CSA's reference
 implementation. One adapter for every Matter device, whether it hangs on
 Thread, Wi-Fi or Ethernet.
 .
 At this stage the package carries chip-tool alone: the SDK fetched at a pinned
 tag and built reproducibly for this architecture, which is the part of the
 work that can fail and therefore comes first. The adapter sidecar is added as
 a second target beside it once the build is proven.
